{"case_id": "628cfc5e9bb2aac87ab4ac21", "role": "薰儿", "context": "薰儿：（身旁一阵香风袭来，轻灵的笑声）萧炎哥哥今天的表现，可真让人惊讶啊。\n萧炎：（摸了摸鼻子，笑了笑）\n薰儿：（纤手负在身后，微偏着小脑袋，若有深意的微笑）我原本也以为萧炎哥哥不会斗技，可没想到，却如此深藏不露。\n萧炎：（嘴角一弯，戏谑的道）嘿嘿，哪有薰儿深藏不露，上次在斗技堂你所使用的斗技，也不是普通东西啊。", "response": "薰儿：（俏皮地眨了眨眼）哦？那萧炎哥哥想不想见识一下呢？", "source_rows": [71, 1142, 3886, 7135], "human_scores": {"empathy": 1}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "628cfc5e9bb2aac87ab4ac21", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "628cfc5e9bb2aac87ab4ac21", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "628cfc5e9bb2aac87ab4ac21", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "628cfc5e9bb2aac87ab4ac21", "human": 1, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 4}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "628cfc5e9bb2aac87ab4ac21", "human": 1, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 4}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "628cfc5e9bb2aac87ab4ac21", "human": 1, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 4}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "628cfc5e9bb2aac87ab4ac21", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "628cfc5e9bb2aac87ab4ac21", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "628cfc5e9bb2aac87ab4ac21", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "0f0bf37b3dabc17e10f5521c", "role": "陈美嘉", "context": "胡一菲：（站起身，就要拉她出去）不说是吧？那我就扭送你出去游街示众……\n陈美嘉：（马上叛变）好吧！不过我告诉你一个人，别告诉别人哦！\n胡一菲：（凑过耳朵）说！\n陈美嘉：（惺惺作态地说）子乔今天晚上要在家里举办一个场秘密PARTY。还是会员制的。只有帅哥美女才能来参加。所以，他送票子给你们去看老年艺术团表演，然后才能甩掉你们。\n胡一菲：（惊呆了）会员制PARTY？\n陈美嘉：（继续出卖子乔）是啊，他根本不打算告诉你们，不过我实在忍不下去了。哪怕忍着病痛，我还是要告诉你真相。\n胡一菲：（粗心大意，忽略掉美嘉的存在）子乔这个小畜牲，要搞homePARTY，居然不邀请我？\n陈美嘉：（煽风点火）他经常这么做，上次纳凉晚会是一次，五月天演唱会是另一次。\n胡一菲：（咬牙切齿地说）他死定了。", "response": "陈美嘉：（假装无辜）我只是个传话的，你可别怪我啊。", "source_rows": [871], "human_scores": {"empathy": 1}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "0f0bf37b3dabc17e10f5521c", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "0f0bf37b3dabc17e10f5521c", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "0f0bf37b3dabc17e10f5521c", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "0f0bf37b3dabc17e10f5521c", "human": 1, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 4}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "0f0bf37b3dabc17e10f5521c", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "0f0bf37b3dabc17e10f5521c", "human": 1, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 4}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "0f0bf37b3dabc17e10f5521c", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "0f0bf37b3dabc17e10f5521c", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "0f0bf37b3dabc17e10f5521c", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "e72078fab3f60eba4fe174b0", "role": "杨过", "context": "赵志敬：（和颜悦色的）过儿，你过来。\n杨过：（疑惑）你打不打我？\n赵志敬：（解释）我传你功夫，打你作甚？", "response": "杨过：（怀疑）那你上次为什么要打我？", "source_rows": [3047], "human_scores": {"empathy": 1}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e72078fab3f60eba4fe174b0", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e72078fab3f60eba4fe174b0", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e72078fab3f60eba4fe174b0", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e72078fab3f60eba4fe174b0", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e72078fab3f60eba4fe174b0", "human": 1, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 4}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e72078fab3f60eba4fe174b0", "human": 1, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 4}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e72078fab3f60eba4fe174b0", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e72078fab3f60eba4fe174b0", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e72078fab3f60eba4fe174b0", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "01959fdcdf6136e26906f051", "role": "宋江", "context": "青衣女童：（迳到厨边，举口）小童奉娘娘法旨，请星主说话。", "response": "宋江：（在神厨里一头抖，一头偷眼看时，不敢做声）", "source_rows": [1042, 1590, 1660, 2136, 2875, 4024, 5013, 6570], "human_scores": {"empathy": 1}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "01959fdcdf6136e26906f051", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "01959fdcdf6136e26906f051", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "01959fdcdf6136e26906f051", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "01959fdcdf6136e26906f051", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "01959fdcdf6136e26906f051", "human": 1, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 4}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "01959fdcdf6136e26906f051", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "01959fdcdf6136e26906f051", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "01959fdcdf6136e26906f051", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "01959fdcdf6136e26906f051", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "562dd36f8f55752ab7c3f0ae", "role": "宋江", "context": "宋江：贤弟水路来？旱路来？\n燕青：乘传到此。\n宋江：戴宗回时，说道已进兵攻取湖州，其事如何？\n燕青：（禀报军情）自离宣州，卢先锋分兵两处：先锋自引一半军马攻打湖州，杀死伪留守弓温并手下副将五员，收伏了湖州，杀散了贼兵，安抚了百姓，一面行文申覆张招讨，拨统制守御，特令燕青来报捷。主将所分这一半人马，叫林冲引领前去，攻取独松关，都到杭州聚会。小弟来时，听得说独松关路上每日杀，取不得关，先锋又同朱武去了，嘱付委呼延灼将军统领军兵，守住湖州，待中军招讨调拨得统制到来，护境安民，才一面进兵，攻取德清县，到杭州会合。\n宋江：湖州守御取德清，并调去独松关杀，两处分的人将，你且说与我姓名，共是几人去，并几人跟呼延灼来。\n燕青：（列举人员名单）有单在此。分去独松关杀取关，现有正偏将佐二十三员：先锋卢俊义朱武林冲董平张清解珍解宝吕方郭盛欧鹏邓飞李忠周通邹渊邹润孙新顾大嫂李立白胜汤隆朱贵朱富时迁现在湖州守御，即日进兵德清县，现有正偏将佐一十九员：呼延灼索超穆弘雷横杨雄刘唐单廷魏定国陈达杨春薛永杜迁穆春李云石勇龚旺丁得孙张青孙二娘。这两处将佐，通计四十二员。小弟来时，那里商议定了，目下进兵。", "response": "宋江：那林冲兄弟又同谁却去取关？", "source_rows": [3979], "human_scores": {"empathy": 1}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "562dd36f8f55752ab7c3f0ae", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "562dd36f8f55752ab7c3f0ae", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "562dd36f8f55752ab7c3f0ae", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "562dd36f8f55752ab7c3f0ae", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "562dd36f8f55752ab7c3f0ae", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "562dd36f8f55752ab7c3f0ae", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "562dd36f8f55752ab7c3f0ae", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "562dd36f8f55752ab7c3f0ae", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "562dd36f8f55752ab7c3f0ae", "human": 1, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 4}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "1a7903589f73e2e9022c7464", "role": "孙悟空", "context": "孙悟空：（飞近八戒耳边，假捏声音）猪悟能！猪悟能！\n猪八戒：（慌了）晦气呀！我这悟能是观世音菩萨起的，自跟了唐僧，又呼做八戒，此间怎么有人知道我叫做悟能？（忍不住问道）是那个叫我的法名？\n孙悟空：（假扮勾司人）是我。\n猪八戒：（问）你是那个？", "response": "孙悟空：我是勾司人。", "source_rows": [1299], "human_scores": {"empathy": 1}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "1a7903589f73e2e9022c7464", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "1a7903589f73e2e9022c7464", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "1a7903589f73e2e9022c7464", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "1a7903589f73e2e9022c7464", "human": 1, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 4}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "1a7903589f73e2e9022c7464", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "1a7903589f73e2e9022c7464", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "1a7903589f73e2e9022c7464", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "1a7903589f73e2e9022c7464", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "1a7903589f73e2e9022c7464", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "05d7de25d0fcbf010348a704", "role": "李云龙", "context": "田雨：首长，照您这么说，被俘投降的是没有气节，该枪毙，负隅顽抗的虽说有气节可也该被消灭，总之都得死。\n李云龙：（斩钉截铁地说）对，对付日本人就该这样。\n田雨：首长，您听说过日内瓦公约吗？\n李云龙：没听说过。\n田雨：（有点儿放肆地说）真没文化。\n李云龙：（不吭声了）\n田雨：对不起首长，我和您开玩笑呢，可不许生气。\n李云龙：（大度地说）没事，是没文化嘛，我承认。等全国解放后我也要去上学，不能总这样。\n田雨：那个赵政委给您熏出点儿什么香呢？\n李云龙：（精神地说）多了，多了，那小子喜欢诗，教了我不少，不过大多数记不住了，有的还记得，听着，我给你背一段儿。\n田雨：（拍掌笑道）好呀，快背。\n李云龙：（不好意思地说）醉里挑灯看剑，梦回吹角连营，八百里分摩下炙，五十弦翻塞外声……唉？他娘的，下面想不起来啦。\n田雨：沙场秋点兵……\n李云龙：（不好意思地说）对，对，看我这记性。我说小田呀，你也懂诗？我还真没看出来。\n田雨：（不以为然地翻翻眼皮说）那还是我五六岁背的。", "response": "李云龙：（大笑着说）你这娃儿，真有意思。我喜欢跟你这样的人打交道。", "source_rows": [2368, 5601], "human_scores": {"empathy": 1}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "05d7de25d0fcbf010348a704", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "05d7de25d0fcbf010348a704", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "05d7de25d0fcbf010348a704", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "05d7de25d0fcbf010348a704", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "05d7de25d0fcbf010348a704", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "05d7de25d0fcbf010348a704", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "05d7de25d0fcbf010348a704", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "05d7de25d0fcbf010348a704", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "05d7de25d0fcbf010348a704", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_e