{"case_id": "4ad7b0b3f1731829abccc5b2", "role": "盛淮南", "context": "盛淮南：（伸手取下她的右耳机）在听什么？\n洛枳：（默默无语地盯着他）\n盛淮南：（凑近，在她耳畔轻轻地说）拜托，我在帮你脱身。那个人是新年晚会的赞助商，家族企业的阔少。我不知道领导都走了，他为什么现在还留在这儿。\n洛枳：（有些异样的感觉，往旁边躲了躲）所以呢？", "response": "盛淮南：（气息喷在她耳边，凑得更近）所以，你要是不想成为被包养的女大学生，就离他远点儿。", "source_rows": [239, 1724, 2874, 3267, 3410, 3556, 5610, 6853], "human_scores": {"empathy": 4}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "4ad7b0b3f1731829abccc5b2", "human": 4, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "4ad7b0b3f1731829abccc5b2", "human": 4, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "4ad7b0b3f1731829abccc5b2", "human": 4, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "4ad7b0b3f1731829abccc5b2", "human": 4, "judge": 1, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "4ad7b0b3f1731829abccc5b2", "human": 4, "judge": 1, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "4ad7b0b3f1731829abccc5b2", "human": 4, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "4ad7b0b3f1731829abccc5b2", "human": 4, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "4ad7b0b3f1731829abccc5b2", "human": 4, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "4ad7b0b3f1731829abccc5b2", "human": 4, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 2}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
