{"case_id": "24d010f050c63633297c6c0d", "role": "吕秀才", "context": "郭芙蓉：（微笑）看什么看，没有看过人家扫地啊？\n吕秀才：（走到小郭旁，微笑）就喜欢看你扫地。你累不累？要不你歇会儿，我给你倒碗水去。\n郭芙蓉：（急忙冲过来）哎呀，你没事儿没事吧侯哥？烫着没有？", "response": "吕秀才：（微笑）别急，小事一桩，没烫到。你看，我这就好了。以后你别这么急，小心跌倒。", "source_rows": [6726], "human_scores": {"empathy": 2}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "24d010f050c63633297c6c0d", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "24d010f050c63633297c6c0d", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "24d010f050c63633297c6c0d", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "24d010f050c63633297c6c0d", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "24d010f050c63633297c6c0d", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "24d010f050c63633297c6c0d", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "24d010f050c63633297c6c0d", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "24d010f050c63633297c6c0d", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "24d010f050c63633297c6c0d", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "2bbc95757444c678d76117b2", "role": "唐宛如", "context": "唐宛如：（惊慌大叫）顾里！！着火了，快点通知他们！\n顾里：（怒吼）如果你想早点死的话你尽管拨出去！\n唐宛如：（哆嗦着握住顾里的肩）怎么办？怎么办？！里面还有崇光、顾准、南湘、Neil！\n顾里：（沉着脸，掰开唐宛如的手）顾不上他们了。再不逃我们也逃不掉了。", "response": "唐宛如：（大声喊道）林萧！你听到了吗？我们在外面，快点来救我们！", "source_rows": [1334, 1899, 2215, 2352, 2942, 3630, 5864, 6175, 6336], "human_scores": {"empathy": 1}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "2bbc95757444c678d76117b2", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "2bbc95757444c678d76117b2", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "2bbc95757444c678d76117b2", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "2bbc95757444c678d76117b2", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "2bbc95757444c678d76117b2", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "2bbc95757444c678d76117b2", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "2bbc95757444c678d76117b2", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "2bbc95757444c678d76117b2", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "2bbc95757444c678d76117b2", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "884a0974f262eb1bc6532c12", "role": "郭襄", "context": "金轮法王：（停住马匹）小姑娘，你是谁？怎么一个人在这儿？\n郭襄：（微微一笑）我姓郭，要去找一个人。\n金轮法王：你去找谁？\n郭襄：（侧过头）老和尚多管闲事，我不跟你说。\n金轮法王：你要找的人是怎生模样，或许我曾在道上见过，便可指点途径。\n郭襄：（想了想）我要找的那人最好认不过，是个没有右臂的青年男子。他或许是和一只大雕在一块儿，也或许只有他独自一人。\n金轮法王：（笑容满面）啊，你要找的人姓杨名过，是不是？\n郭襄：（大喜）是啊，你识得他？\n金轮法王：（随口说出）我怎不识得？他是我的小朋友。我识得他的时候，你还没出世呢。\n郭襄：（脸上一阵红晕）大和尚，你叫甚么法名啊？\n金轮法王：我叫珠穆朗玛。", "response": "郭襄：（好奇）这是蒙古话呢还是西藏话？", "source_rows": [338, 1839, 2219, 3899], "human_scores": {"empathy": 2}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "884a0974f262eb1bc6532c12", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "884a0974f262eb1bc6532c12", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "884a0974f262eb1bc6532c12", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "884a0974f262eb1bc6532c12", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "884a0974f262eb1bc6532c12", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "884a0974f262eb1bc6532c12", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "884a0974f262eb1bc6532c12", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "884a0974f262eb1bc6532c12", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "884a0974f262eb1bc6532c12", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "407dd23ff066eaa74cf93f1d", "role": "景天", "context": "少女：（猛然想起手中还抓着那枚读蒺藜）你没事罢？\n景天：（满不在乎道）没事，一点小伤算不了什么。堂堂男子汉大丈夫……（大惊失色道）有……有读！？完了，我还这么年轻，就要……\n少女：（笑了出来）放心，一时三刻si不了的。我有解药……\n景天：（大喜）真的？快给我！\n少女：此刻我没带在身上。我可以回去拿给你，但你须替我办一件事。", "response": "景天：哎？！你……你这是讹人啊！你这个坏女人，居然敢乘人之危……（无奈）好吧，只要我能做到的，我一定帮你。但是你得保证，给我解药！", "source_rows": [1182, 4392, 6194, 7190], "human_scores": {"empathy": 2}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "407dd23ff066eaa74cf93f1d", "human": 2, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 0}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "407dd23ff066eaa74cf93f1d", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "407dd23ff066eaa74cf93f1d", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "407dd23ff066eaa74cf93f1d", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "407dd23ff066eaa74cf93f1d", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "407dd23ff066eaa74cf93f1d", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "407dd23ff066eaa74cf93f1d", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "407dd23ff066eaa74cf93f1d", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "407dd23ff066eaa74cf93f1d", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "7b6ddf102b1186c200d4f4bb", "role": "许沁", "context": "许沁：（拎着垃圾袋放到门边，回到池子旁洗手）后天星期一,你要上班了？\n宋焰：（正往碗里盛粥）嗯，我这病假也休息得够久了。\n许沁：（关上水龙头）那我要一个月后才能见到你了？\n宋焰：（侧眸看她一眼）要一个人住,不习惯了？", "response": "许沁：（有些不好意思）嗯，以前也没一个人住过，怕不习惯。", "source_rows": [994], "human_scores": {"empathy": 2}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "7b6ddf102b1186c200d4f4bb", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "7b6ddf102b1186c200d4f4bb", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "7b6ddf102b1186c200d4f4bb", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "7b6ddf102b1186c200d4f4bb", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "7b6ddf102b1186c200d4f4bb", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "7b6ddf102b1186c200d4f4bb", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "7b6ddf102b1186c200d4f4bb", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "7b6ddf102b1186c200d4f4bb", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "7b6ddf102b1186c200d4f4bb", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "e1d460ddc9ca53f17909c1ea", "role": "公子羽", "context": "公子羽：（淡淡地）陈老板不但老实敦厚，而且见多识广，做见证正是再好也没有的了！\n傅红雪：（平静地）是。\n公子羽：（平静地）能够请到倪老先生来做我们的见证，实在是我们的荣幸。\n傅红雪：（平静地）是。\n公子羽：（平静地）我请来这三位见证你都不反对？\n傅红雪：（摇摇头）。\n公子羽：（平静地）高手相争，正如国手对弈，一着之失，满盘皆输，所以连心情都受不得半点影响。\n傅红雪：（平静地）我知道。", "response": "公子羽：（平静地）你既然知道，那么就应该明白，这场比试的结果，并不是最重要的。", "source_rows": [5231], "human_scores": {"empathy": 5}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e1d460ddc9ca53f17909c1ea", "human": 5, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e1d460ddc9ca53f17909c1ea", "human": 5, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e1d460ddc9ca53f17909c1ea", "human": 5, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e1d460ddc9ca53f17909c1ea", "human": 5, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e1d460ddc9ca53f17909c1ea", "human": 5, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e1d460ddc9ca53f17909c1ea", "human": 5, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e1d460ddc9ca53f17909c1ea", "human": 5, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e1d460ddc9ca53f17909c1ea", "human": 5, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "e1d460ddc9ca53f17909c1ea", "human": 5, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "a325c020b715fb22c8f02809", "role": "吕秀才", "context": "吕秀才：（按无双的头）一二三，我就走你！\n祝无双：哎哎，疼疼疼疼，疼\n吕秀才：再坚持一下，再坚持一下就好了（又按）\n祝无双：哦，啊－不行不行，你再挤我的脑袋就要爆了，喔哎呦（把头退回来）咝，噢呦（坐下）", "response": "吕秀才：（坐下，揉揉无双的头）抱歉，抱歉，我可能有点急切了。咱们开始吧，有什么我可以帮助你的吗？", "source_rows": [577, 5986], "human_scores": {"empathy": 1}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "a325c020b715fb22c8f02809", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "a325c020b715fb22c8f02809", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "a325c020b715fb22c8f02809", "human": 1, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "a325c020b715fb22c8f02809", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "a325c020b715fb22c8f02809", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "a325c020b715fb22c8f02809", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "a325c020b715fb22c8f02809", "human": 1, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "a325c020b715fb22c8f02809", "human": 1, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 1}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
