{"case_id": "84f7e85ea00a52cfaa93aced", "role": "飞流", "context": "梅长苏：（托着下巴）应该是要送你最喜欢的给他吧……\n飞流：不行！\n梅长苏：为什么不行？\n飞流：苏哥哥！\n梅长苏：（一笑）你最喜欢的是苏哥哥啊？那当然不能送了……那送那件金丝背心好不好？", "response": "飞流：好！", "source_rows": [3567, 6547], "human_scores": {"empathy": 2}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "84f7e85ea00a52cfaa93aced", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "84f7e85ea00a52cfaa93aced", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "84f7e85ea00a52cfaa93aced", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "84f7e85ea00a52cfaa93aced", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "84f7e85ea00a52cfaa93aced", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "84f7e85ea00a52cfaa93aced", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "84f7e85ea00a52cfaa93aced", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "84f7e85ea00a52cfaa93aced", "human": 2, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 0}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "84f7e85ea00a52cfaa93aced", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "919190309222d949f90388d1", "role": "重楼", "context": "景天：（忽然想起一事）慢！我有一个疑问，为什么我们每次遇到危险，你都能及时赶到？真是太巧了！\n重楼：（冷然）哼！什么太巧了？那是我留下了刻印和魔灵……\n景天：（摸摸脑袋，不解其意）刻印？魔灵？那是什么？", "response": "重楼：（皱眉）就是我在你们身上留下的印记，通过它们我可以感知你们的存在，知道你们的处境。", "source_rows": [2, 1662, 1849, 2401, 2744, 3543, 4874], "human_scores": {"empathy": 5}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "919190309222d949f90388d1", "human": 5, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "919190309222d949f90388d1", "human": 5, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "919190309222d949f90388d1", "human": 5, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "919190309222d949f90388d1", "human": 5, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "919190309222d949f90388d1", "human": 5, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "919190309222d949f90388d1", "human": 5, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "919190309222d949f90388d1", "human": 5, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "919190309222d949f90388d1", "human": 5, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "919190309222d949f90388d1", "human": 5, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 2}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
{"case_id": "ca506a707a92b4b0fb8e06a3", "role": "小龙女", "context": "杨过：（伸臂扶住她肩膀，柔声）姑姑，我义父做事颠三倒四，你莫跟他一般见识。\n小龙女：（将脸蛋藏在他怀里，腻腻糊糊的）你自己才颠三倒四呢，不怕丑，还说人家！\n杨过：（见她举止与平昔大异，稍觉慌乱）姑姑，我……我……\n小龙女：（抬起头来，嗔道）你还叫我姑姑？\n杨过：（更加慌了，顺口）我不叫你姑姑叫甚幺？要我叫师父幺？", "response": "小龙女：（笑道）你是不是应该叫我夫人？", "source_rows": [3983, 5385], "human_scores": {"empathy": 2}, "judgments": [{"provider": "deepseek", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "ca506a707a92b4b0fb8e06a3", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "ca506a707a92b4b0fb8e06a3", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "deepseek", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "ca506a707a92b4b0fb8e06a3", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "ca506a707a92b4b0fb8e06a3", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "ca506a707a92b4b0fb8e06a3", "human": 2, "judge": 2, "absolute_error": 0}, {"provider": "gemini", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "ca506a707a92b4b0fb8e06a3", "human": 2, "judge": 5, "absolute_error": 3}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "direct", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "ca506a707a92b4b0fb8e06a3", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "rationale", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "ca506a707a92b4b0fb8e06a3", "human": 2, "judge": 4, "absolute_error": 2}, {"provider": "qwen", "style": "anchored", "dimension": "empathy", "case_id": "ca506a707a92b4b0fb8e06a3", "human": 2, "judge": 3, "absolute_error": 1}], "review_status": "agent_review_complete"}
